# Dropdown Arrow Key Navigation Test
# Tests that arrow keys navigate between options in an open dropdown
# and Enter selects the highlighted option
#
# Uses raw key commands since UI-aware commands (click_ui, click_text)
# require was_rendered_to_screen which isn't set in headless e2e mode.

goto_screen dropdowns
wait 1.0

# Verify screen loaded
expect_text "Dropdown Showcase"

# Tab to the first dropdown's trigger button
key TAB
wait 0.3

# Open the dropdown by pressing Enter
key ENTER
wait 0.5

# Screenshot with dropdown open
screenshot dropdown_open_initial

# Arrow down once to move from Alpha (index 0) to Beta (index 1)
key DOWN
wait 0.3

# Screenshot showing highlight moved to Beta
screenshot dropdown_arrow_down_once

# Arrow down again to move to Gamma (index 2)
key DOWN
wait 0.3

# Screenshot showing highlight on Gamma
screenshot dropdown_arrow_down_twice

# Arrow up to go back to Beta (index 1)
key UP
wait 0.3

# Select Beta by pressing Enter
key ENTER
wait 0.5

# Take final screenshot showing Beta selected (trigger should show "Beta v")
screenshot dropdown_after_arrow_select
